node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist

# Must go with dist: tsc reads it, concludes the build is current and emits nothing, leaving the
# image with no dist at all.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.next
**/.turbo
.git
.github
.vscode
.claude

# Secrets must never reach an image layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

**/*.log
**/coverage
docs
README.md
